practice.instructions:
You receive this complex nested object from an API:

```json
{
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "personal": {
        "firstName": "John",
        "lastName": "Doe",
        "age": 30
      },
      "contact": {
        "email": "john@example.com",
        "phone": "555-0123"
      }
    },
    "subscription": {
      "tier": "premium",
      "active": true
    }
  }
}
```

Transform it into this flat structure:
```json
{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "555-0123",
  "isPremium": true,
  "age": 30
}
```

